  "body_html": "<h1>farkas_lemma</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem farkas_lemma (A : I → Fin n → 𝕜) (b : I → 𝕜) (c : Fin n → 𝕜) (d : 𝕜) (hS : IsFeasible A b) : (∀ x : Fin n → 𝕜, (∀ i, b i ≤ ∑ j, A i j * x j) → d ≤ ∑ j, c j * x j) ↔ (∃ u : I → 𝕜, (∀ i, 0 ≤ u i) ∧ (∀ j, ∑ i, u i * A i j = c j) ∧ d ≤ ∑ i, u i * b i)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsRegularMyersonOptimalICIRAuction.isFeasible</li>\n<li>IsFeasible</li>\n<li>farkasAugA</li>\n<li>farkasAugB</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>rowEval</li>\n<li>HasCertificate</li>\n<li>theorem_of_alternative</li>\n</ul>",
